1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,870
(Howard:)that makes it kind of hard
to face her now.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,540
(Leonard:)That covers anything
from farting in bed

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:08,180
(Leonard:)to killing a homeless guy.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,380
(Leonard:)Oh, my God.

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,320
(Leonard:)You ran over a hobo.

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,620
(Howard:)No. Stop asking.

7
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,320
(Leonard:)All right, fine. So you want to
get back together with her,

8
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,890
(Leonard:)but you're too
ashamed to face her

9
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:20,560
(Leonard:)because of whatever
it is you did.

10
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,760
(Howard:)In a nutshell.
Okay.

11
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,460
(Leonard:)Well, how about this?

12
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,630
(Leonard:)Kidnap Bernadette from the opera

13
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:28,930
(Leonard:)wearing a creepy mask so
she doesn't know it's you.

14
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:32,940
(Howard:)Now, you see, I don't know
if you're kidding or not.

15
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,040
(Raj:)You're being
unreasonable.

16
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:37,280
(Raj:)Why can't
I have a desk?!

17
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,440
(Sheldon:)Our collaboration is a work
of the mind.

18
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,880
(Sheldon:)We don't need desks.

19
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,110
(Raj:)You have a desk.

20
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,950
(Sheldon:)Correct.
But I can't have one.

21
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:46,350
(Sheldon:)You're two for two.

22
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,120
(Leonard:)Why can't he have a desk,
Sheldon?

23
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:49,850
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord, will
this day never end?

24
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:52,990
(Sheldon:)As I've explained repeatedly
to Dr. Koothrappali,

25
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:55,390
(Sheldon:)whose ability to comprehend
the American idiom fails him

26
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:56,800
(Sheldon:)when it's convenient,

27
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,300
(Sheldon:)there's absolutely
no money

28
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,900
(Sheldon:)in my budget for
additional office furniture.

